  IconPath: systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/background.svg
  Description: Your parents conceived you for a fell purpose at a site tainted by
    death, like a wight's barrow, mass grave, or ossuary. Their reasons could be
    a mystery, or you might know of their grand design and seek to escape-or fulfill-their
    plans. Either way, you're at your most dangerous when near death. Choose two
    attribute boosts. One must be to Dexterity or Constitution , and one is a free
    attribute boost. You're trained in the Undead Lore skill. You gain the @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.Final
    Spite] reaction.
